<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cardiac Pathways started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cardiac Pathways started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst David Gruber said he started coverage of Cardiac Pathways Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the developer of mapping and ablation equipment for cardiac tachyarrhythmia management were up 1/4 to 6-1/2.</p>
<p>--Gruber said the company has 55 issued and 52 pending patents, is developing a broad range of products, offers value as a potential acquisition candidate and is substantially undervalued.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
